<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>7-Chakra Ascension | The Magician's Path</title>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #070b0d;
  --panel: #101719;
  --teal: #0d9488;
  --mint: #17bfa9;
  --gold: #e9c56a;
  --text: #f5f3ee;
  --muted: #b9c3c1;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.container {
  width: min(900px, calc(100% - 36px));
  margin: auto;
}

header {
  padding: 24px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 13px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff15;
}

section {
  padding: 65px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff12;
}

.hero { text-align: center; }

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--mint);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .18em;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 76px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -.05em;
  margin: 15px 0;
}

h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -.035em;
}

.gold { color: var(--gold); }

.lead {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 19px;
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 20px auto;
}

.vsl {
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  background: #11191b;
  border: 1px solid #e9c56a55;
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 35px auto;
}

.vsl iframe {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border: 0;
}

.cover {
  display: block;
  width: min(100%, 390px);
  margin: 35px auto;
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 65px #000a;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 17px 30px;
  background: linear-gradient(110deg, var(--teal), var(--mint));
  color: #031413;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

.price {
  font-size: 44px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--gold);
}

.panel {
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid #e9c56a35;
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 32px;
}

.chakra {
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid #ffffff18;
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 23px;
  margin: 14px 0;
}

.chakra h3 {
  color: var(--gold);
  margin: 0 0 7px;
}

.chakra p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

.center { text-align: center; }

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>THE MAGICIAN'S PATH</header>

<main>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="eyebrow">Seven Guided Meditations</div>

    <h1>7-CHAKRA<br><span class="gold">ASCENSION</span></h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Identify the pattern. Explore its roots.
      Choose a different direction.
    </p>

    <div class="vsl">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/JhHoR2T7x34"
        title="7-Chakra Ascension Video Presentation"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </div>

    <h2>
      You might not have a discipline problem.
      <span class="gold">You might have an identity problem.</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="lead">
      You know who you want to become.
      So why do you keep returning to the same patterns?
    </p>

    <img
      class="cover"
      src="seven-chakra-ascension-cover.png"
      alt="7-Chakra Ascension Product Cover"
    >

    <div class="price">$111</div>

    <p>Complete Seven-Meditation Series</p>

    <a class="btn" href="#offer">
      GET 7-CHAKRA ASCENSION →
    </a>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">

    <h2 class="center">
      What if these aren't
      <span class="gold">separate problems?</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="panel">
      <p>You hesitate when it's time to act.</p>

      <p>
        You hide your creativity because
        you're afraid of judgment.
      </p>

      <p>
        You seek validation from other people,
        even when you know it won't fulfill you.
      </p>

      <p>
        You sabotage yourself when you're
        finally getting somewhere.
      </p>

      <p>
        What if these are expressions of deeper patterns
        influencing who you believe you're allowed to become?
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container center">

    <div class="eyebrow">The Magician's Path Framework</div>

    <h2>
      The pattern didn't necessarily
      <span class="gold">begin with you.</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="lead">
      Your upbringing, experiences, relationships,
      and environment influence how you see yourself.
    </p>

    <p class="lead">
      In The Magician's Path framework,
      these patterns are explored through
      the concept of pain bodies:
      emotional charges and limiting beliefs
      associated with the seven chakras.
    </p>

    <p class="lead">
      The work begins with recognizing the pattern,
      exploring its roots, and practicing
      a different response.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">

    <h2 class="center">
      Seven Chakras.
      <span class="gold">Seven Pain Bodies.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="chakra">
      <h3>01 — ROOT CHAKRA</h3>
      <p>
        Fear of Safety.
        Explore where you learned that
        expressing yourself or moving forward
        might be unsafe.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="chakra">
      <h3>02 — SACRAL CHAKRA</h3>
      <p>
        Fear of Judgment.
        Explore the shame and fear that
        may be keeping your creative
        self hidden.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="chakra">
      <h3>03 — SOLAR PLEXUS CHAKRA</h3>
      <p>
        Inability to Take Action.
        Explore the beliefs and patterns
        that interfere with execution.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="chakra">
      <h3>04 — HEART CHAKRA</h3>
      <p>
        Fear of Scarcity in Love.
        Explore your relationship with
        self-love, connection,
        and receiving love.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="chakra">
      <h3>05 — THROAT CHAKRA</h3>
      <p>
        Fear of Being Misunderstood.
        Explore what prevents you
        from expressing your message.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="chakra">
      <h3>06 — THIRD EYE CHAKRA</h3>
      <p>
        Disconnection from Spirit.
        Explore your relationship
        with intuition and your
        higher purpose.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="chakra">
      <h3>07 — CROWN CHAKRA</h3>
      <p>
        Connection to the Infinite.
        Explore faith, surrender,
        and your connection
        to something greater.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container center">

    <h2>
      Insight alone
      <span class="gold">doesn't create change.</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="lead">
      The Magician's Path is built around
      identity, awareness, intentional practice,
      and action.
    </p>

    <p class="lead">
      These seven meditations give you
      a structured way to explore the patterns
      associated with each chakra.
    </p>

    <p class="lead">
      Return to the practice.
      Reflect on what comes up.
      Then bring that awareness
      into the way you live.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="offer">
  <div class="container center">

    <div class="panel">

      <div class="eyebrow">Begin Your Practice</div>

      <h2>
        7-CHAKRA
        <span class="gold">ASCENSION</span>
      </h2>

      <p>
        Seven guided meditations exploring
        the pain-body patterns associated
        with each chakra.
      </p>

      <div class="price">$111</div>

      <a
        class="btn"
        href="https://the-draw-mp.whop.site/">
        GET THE COMPLETE SERIES →
      </a>

      <p style="font-size:12px;color:#9aa9a5">
        Replace this link with your direct Whop checkout.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  THE MAGICIAN'S PATH<br>
  WHERE SCIENCE MEETS THE SACRED
</footer>

</body>
</html>
